arned that there is a major need for junk removal and yard-cleanup in the Denver area, so I decided to start Mile High haul-off in 2023 with an emphasis on providing excellent customer service at an affordable rate.<\/p>\n<p>When I am not removing junk or exterminating pests around Denver, you can find me spending time with my family and enjoying everything this great state of Colorado has to offer, including hiking, camping, hunting, and snowboarding.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][vc_empty_space empty_h=&#8221;2&#8243;][vc_row_inner limit_content=&#8221;&#8221;][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/1&#8243;][uncode_index el_id=&#8221;index-373564085&#8243; index_type=&#8221;carousel&#8221; loop=&#8221;size:9|order_by:date|post_type:page|by_id:21322,12,10,103348,22179|taxonomy_count:10&#8243; carousel_lg=&#8221;3&#8243; carousel_md=&#8221;2&#8243; carousel_sm=&#8221;1&#8243; thumb_size=&#8221;two-one&#8221; gutter_size=&#8221;3&#8243; post_items=&#8221;media|featured|onpost|original,date,title,sep-one|full,extra,icon&#8221; page_items=&#8221;media|featured|onpost|original,title,text|excerpt|120,sep-one|full,link|link|small_size|Learn More,icon|sm&#8221; service_items=&#8221;media|featured|onpost|original,title,detail-105568,sep-one|full,link|link|default_size|View Service,icon|sm&#8221; portfolio_items=&#8221;media|featured|onpost|original,icon|md&#8221; carousel_height=&#8221;equal&#8221; carousel_interval=&#8221;0&#8243; carousel_navspeed=&#8221;400&#8243; carousel_dots=&#8221;yes&#8221; carousel_dots_mobile=&#8221;yes&#8221; carousel_dot_position=&#8221;left&#8221; carousel_width_percent=&#8221;100&#8243; stage_padding=&#8221;0&#8243; single_back_color=&#8221;color-xsdn&#8221; single_shape=&#8221;round&#8221; single_overlay_color=&#8221;color-wayh&#8221; single_overlay_opacity=&#8221;50&#8243; single_h_align=&#8221;center&#8221; single_padding=&#8221;2&#8243; single_title_dimension=&#8221;h3&#8243; single_text_lead=&#8221;small&#8221; single_css